    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14529" root="ربع" body-key="r">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استربعهُ</span></b>  <i>He had power,</i> or <i>ability, for it,
to do it,</i> or <i>to bear</i> or <i>endure it:</i> (IAar:) from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبَعَ الحَجَرَ</span>. (Az.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence also,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استربع</span> said
of a camel, <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, strong,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلسَّيْرِ</span> <i>for
journeying.</i> (ISk, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>It</i> (sand) <i>became
heaped up.</i> (AZ, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>It</i> (dust) <i>rose;</i> or <i>rose
high.</i> (AZ, K.)

